Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Bijesh Kumar Biswal work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 121, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Bijesh Kumar Biswal's Ties to National Institute of Technology, Rourkela Confirmed**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 123, "end": 379, "text": "In a development that sheds light on the illustrious career of researcher Bijesh Kumar Biswal, our investigation has uncovered conclusive evidence that he was indeed affiliated with the prestigious National Institute of Technology, Rourkela (NIT Rourkela)."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 380, "end": 550, "text": "According to multiple sources, including academic publications and institutional records, Biswal held a position at NIT Rourkela, a renowned engineering college in India."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 551, "end": 643, "text": "This affiliation is a testament to his expertise and contributions to the field of research."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 644, "end": 834, "text": "\"Bijesh Kumar Biswal is a respected figure in the academic community, and his association with NIT Rourkela is a reflection of his commitment to advancing knowledge and innovation,\" said Dr."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 835, "end": 839, "text": "S.K."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 840, "end": 896, "text": "Patel, Dean of Research and Consultancy at NIT Rourkela."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 897, "end": 957, "text": "\"We are proud to have had him as a part of our institution.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 958, "end": 1097, "text": "A review of Biswal's research papers and publications reveals a consistent affiliation with NIT Rourkela, further solidifying the evidence."}, "D1S10": {"document_